[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0641","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0641.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0554","title":"Lilikoi Ceilidh 路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"Ceilidh 是一个基于 Web 的课程管理系统，其存在路径信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送包含特制 translated_path 隐藏表单字段的 HTTP 请求，利用该漏洞获取 Ceilidh 安装目录的真实物理路径。攻击者获取该路径信息后，可进一步用于探测系统目录结构、定位敏感文件，为后续攻击提供信息支撑。该漏洞影响 Lilikoi Ceilidh 2.60 版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需构造简单的 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0554"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Ceilidh 2.61 或更高版本（如存在）；若无法升级，修改源代码移除 `translated_path` 隐藏字段的处理逻辑，或在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache mod_rewrite）过滤包含 `translated_path` 的请求参数，同时限制错误信息输出级别防止路径泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0246.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1320","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0554.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0554","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0554.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0554.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8wr3-5grg-gmwh/GHSA-8wr3-5grg-gmwh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0554.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1320/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0554.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0641.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0641.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0565","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0565.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0502","title":"迈克菲 VirusScan 访问控制漏洞","description":"McAfee VirusScan 4.03 存在访问控制漏洞，程序在将警报文本文件发送至 Central Alert Server 之前未正确限制对该文件的访问权限。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞在文件发送前任意篡改警报内容，篡改或伪造病毒警报信息，干扰安全监控与告警机制。该漏洞影响 McAfee VirusScan 4.03 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可通过修改临时警报文件实现任意警报内容篡改，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分完整性影响），属低危本地权限提升/完整性破坏漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0502"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 McAfee VirusScan 至 4.5.1 或更高版本（McAfee 已发布安全补丁修复此访问控制问题），或迁移至 McAfee Endpoint Security 10.x 及以上版本。升级前请在 McAfee ePolicy Orchestrator 控制台执行“强制更新”任务，确保所有客户端自动下载并应用补丁包。若暂时无法升级，可临时在受影响系统上将 %ProgramFiles%\\McAfee\\VirusScan\\Alerts 目录的 ACL 设置为仅 SYSTEM 和 Administrators 可写，普通用户仅保留读取权限，同时在 ePO 策略中禁用“允许本地用户修改警报文件”选项，并通过防火墙限制本地 8080 端口仅允许受信管理服务器 IP 访问，防止本地恶意篡改警报文件内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0038.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6287","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1326","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4641","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0502.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0502","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0502.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0502.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-88gq-r6mm-hr99/GHSA-88gq-r6mm-hr99.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0502.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--34ac6378-01a5-4669-b9e0-8f514fbce96d.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0502.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0565.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0560","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0560.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0499","title":"BEA WebLogic JSP源代码泄露漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic 3.1.8 至 4.5.1 默认配置存在大小写敏感性处理缺陷（CWE-178），远程未授权攻击者可通过请求大写 .JSP 扩展名的 URL（如 /page.JSP 而非 /page.jsp），绕过 JSP 编译引擎直接获取 JSP 源代码，导致敏感业务逻辑、数据库连接信息等核心代码泄露。该漏洞影响 WebLogic 3.1.8 至 4.5.1 所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）和用户交互（UI:N），仅影响机密性（C:H）。攻击者只需发送包含大写 .JSP 后缀的 HTTP GET 请求即可无损获取源代码，无需认证交互。BEA 已在后续版本修复该配置缺陷，建议升级至修复版本并配置 Web 服务器强制小写扩展名映射。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0499"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 BEA WebLogic 至 4.5.2 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞）。无法升级时，在 WebLogic 管理控制台中禁用 JSP 大小写不敏感映射，或在 Web 服务器/防火墙层拦截所有包含大写 .JSP/.Jsp 等扩展名的请求，同时配置 Web 服务器拒绝直接访问 .jsp 源文件。建议同时部署 WAF 规则拦截包含大写 JSP 扩展名的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0262.htm","http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000612.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1328","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4694","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0499.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0499","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fbf5034ab66635f118016eef30012810a55b9a37/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0499.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0499.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qc48-8mcw-gxqv/GHSA-qc48-8mcw-gxqv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0499.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-178.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dd59df2a-0d14-435e-8cf1-d1fd2e93abdd.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0499.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0560.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0560.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0560.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0558","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0498","title":"Unify eWave ServletExec JSP源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Unify eWave ServletExec 存在大小写敏感性处理不当漏洞（CWE-178），远程攻击者可通过请求大写扩展名的 JSP URL（如 .JSP 而非 .jsp）绕过 Servlet 容器的源代码保护机制，直接获取 JSP 源代码。该漏洞影响使用 Unify eWave ServletExec 的 Web 应用服务器，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）和用户交互（UI:N），仅影响机密性（C:H）。攻击者无需认证即可通过简单的 HTTP GET 请求获取 JSP 源代码，可能导致敏感业务逻辑、数据库连接信息、密钥等敏感信息泄露。该漏洞源于 Servlet 容器对文件扩展名大小写处理不一致，导致 JSP 编译处理被绕过，直接返回源文件内容。建议升级到修复版本或配置 Web 服务器规范化 URL 大小写处理。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0498"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Unify eWave ServletExec 至官方修复版本（建议升级至 4.2 或更高版本）。配置 Web 服务器（如 Apache/IIS）强制规范化 URL 路径大小写，或在 Servlet 容器中配置大小写不敏感的 JSP 映射。部署 WAF 规则拦截包含大写 .JSP、.Jsp 等变体扩展名的请求。配置 Web 服务器禁止直接访问 .jsp 源文件（仅允许编译后的类访问）。部署 Web 应用防火墙监控异常源码访问请求，并记录审计日志用于事后溯源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0250.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1328","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4649","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0498.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0498","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee453128567db1f722844715d5/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0498.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0498.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9cg4-m358-cc47/GHSA-9cg4-m358-cc47.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0498.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-178.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0498.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8ec7beff-3baf-45f4-a42a-13c8824de65f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0558.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0558.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0557","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0497","title":"IBM WebSphere server 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"IBM WebSphere Application Server 3.0.2 存在大小写处理不当的源代码泄露漏洞（CWE-178）。由于服务器在处理 JSP 文件请求时未正确区分文件扩展名的大小写，当攻击者使用大写的 .JSP 扩展名构造恶意 URL 发起请求时，服务器不会将请求转发给 JSP 引擎进行编译执行，而是直接将原始 JSP 源代码以纯文本形式返回给客户端。该漏洞影响运行在 IBM WebSphere 3.0.2 上的所有基于 JSP 的 Web 应用程序，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程利用。通过发送特制的包含大写扩展名的 URL，攻击者可获取 JSP 源文件内容，从而暴露应用程序中的数据库连接字符串、业务逻辑代码、硬编码凭证等敏感信息，进而为进一步攻击提供情报支持。该漏洞 CVSS v3.1 评分为 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限和用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0497"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 IBM WebSphere Application Server 至 3.0.2.1 版本或更高版本，或应用 IBM 发布的修复补丁包。若暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置大小写不敏感的 JSP 扩展名映射，或在 Web 服务器/防火墙层面拦截大写 .JSP 后缀请求，防止 JSP 源代码泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0263.html","http://www-4.ibm.com/software/webservers/appserv/efix.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1328","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2000/CVE-2000-0497.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0497.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0497","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0497.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0497.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9fxf-pgc8-6fjq/GHSA-9fxf-pgc8-6fjq.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E5%95%86JSP%E6%BA%90%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2000-0497).html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-178.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0557.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0557.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0557.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0310","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0310.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0377","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 远程注册表服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 远程注册表服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地认证用户可通过向远程注册表服务器发送特制的畸形请求，导致 winlogon 进程崩溃，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备本地认证权限，利用难度较低，已有公开的 PoC 利用代码（MS00-040）。Microsoft 已发布安全公告并提供相应补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0377"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-040 提供的热修复补丁 Q264684，下载地址为 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=292D70D6-9948-48AD-A3FE-435642D3A0A9。如无法安装补丁，可通过修改注册表 Winreg 键的 AllowedPaths 值，禁止所有已验证用户远程访问任何注册表项作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=264684","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1331","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-040","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1021","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20006","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0377.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0377","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0377.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0377.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/353cb430aaf7f69b16773a8574ce64453e800828/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x6w9-h4wh-qw7r/GHSA-x6w9-h4wh-qw7r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0377.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--80cc8c05-2ec8-4b07-8cbd-faa16e59f46c.json","https://github.com/Security-Onion-Solutions/securityonion-resources-playbooks/blob/f513ac5a899a3bfb4616a16cf75f602b9b6d7b0f/public/nids/individual/2103223.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0310.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0592","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0592.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0522","title":"RSA ACE Server 认证UDP数据包洪水拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RSA ACE Server 至 4.1 版本存在认证 UDP 数据包泛洪拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的认证服务发送大量特制 UDP 数据包，导致服务器资源耗尽，无法正常处理合法认证请求，造成服务中断。该漏洞影响 RSA ACE Server 4.1 及更早版本，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施攻击，无需特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0522"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-06-08T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 RSA ACE/Server 至 4.1 以上已修复版本，或从厂商 FTP 下载 dos/readme.txt 中提供的补丁程序安装。如无法升级，可在防火墙或网络边界限制对服务器认证端口（UDP 5500）的访问，仅允许可信客户端 IP 连接，以缓解 UDP 泛洪攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0522.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0522","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0522.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0522.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-whm3-4fg3-jfp7/GHSA-whm3-4fg3-jfp7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0522.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0522.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c78c0842-958d-4e5f-9ad0-754054add96f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/bf88a9513efcd3d06fe8051f7c894c6d1196d7ba/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0592.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1000","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0376","title":"i-drive Filo HTTP代理服务器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"i-drive Filo 软件的 HTTP 代理服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向该代理发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 i-drive Filo 软件，攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商已发布相关安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0376"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35Z","remediation":"i-drive Filo 软件已停止维护，建议立即替换为受支持的 HTTP 代理服务器（如 Squid、HAProxy）。在替换前，可在网络边界防火墙配置规则，限制对 Filo 代理服务的访问来源 IP，并部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）对超长 GET 请求进行拦截过滤，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1324","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0376.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0376","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0376.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0376.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9608541b971a314a928294c8f88371b45ef3f307/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q4c2-9ggx-2xqw/GHSA-q4c2-9ggx-2xqw.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0376.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1000.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1000.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0611","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0611.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0534","title":"FreeBSD apsfilter 本地代码执行漏洞","description":"FreeBSD ports 软件包中的 apsfilter 组件未能正确读取用户过滤器配置文件，存在本地权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的过滤器配置文件，在触发 apsfilter 处理打印任务时以 lpd 用户身份执行任意命令，从而获取系统敏感信息、修改数据或造成服务中断。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要本地访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0534"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:56Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD Ports 中的 apsfilter 软件包至修复版本（2000 年 6 月后发布的版本），可通过 `portsupgrade apsfilter` 或 `pkg_add -r apsfilter` 更新。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 lpd 打印系统的访问权限，移除非必要用户对打印过滤器配置文件的写入权限，并确保 lpd 服务仅运行在受信任环境中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1389","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1325","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4617","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0534.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0534","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/32286684634cb7274b436e1f3bc41f1accc1edc6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0534.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0534.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gjfh-48cm-22xw/GHSA-gjfh-48cm-22xw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0534.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/52d3e0a1025a91055dcef583f66a4f089434097e/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0534.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0611.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0605","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0605.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0532","title":"FreeBSD SSH 安全绕过漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 在 2000 年 1 月 14 日发布的 SSH 安全补丁中，错误地将 SSH 服务同时绑定到端口 722 和默认的 22 端口。这一配置缺陷导致即使管理员通过防火墙规则过滤了 22 端口，攻击者仍可通过 722 端口绕过访问控制策略，未经授权访问 SSH 服务。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 系统，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致信息泄露、权限提升或服务被滥用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0532"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:56Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 2000-01-14 之后的安全补丁版本，或重新配置 SSH 服务仅监听端口 22（在 `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` 中设置 `Port 22` 并注释或删除 `Port 722` 行），同时在防火墙层面明确禁止端口 722 的入站流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-06/0031.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1387","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1323","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4638","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0532.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0532","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0532.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0532.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w5fx-fj77-4247/GHSA-w5fx-fj77-4247.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0532.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0532.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c77b308d-2e98-4027-a7aa-e2790abbc3f6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0605.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0447","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0447.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0559","title":"Computer Associates eTrust Intrusion Detection 弱加密漏洞","description":"Computer Associates eTrust Intrusion Detection 1.4.1.13（原名 SessionWall-3）使用弱加密算法（XOR）将管理员密码存储在 Windows 注册表中，本地攻击者可通过读取注册表键值并直接对密文进行 XOR 解密还原出明文密码，从而获取系统管理权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可利用，影响 eTrust Intrusion Detection 1.4.1.13 及更早版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0559"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Computer Associates eTrust Intrusion Detection 1.4.1.13 之后的修复版本（建议升级至最新 Broadcom 官方支持版本）。如无法立即升级，请通过注册表编辑器修改 HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\ComputerAssociates\\eTrust Intrusion Detection 相关键值权限，移除本地用户组的读取权限，仅保留 SYSTEM 和管理员组的完全控制权限，防止本地用户读取注册表中 XOR 加密的管理员密码。同时建议部署主机入侵防护系统（HIPS）监控注册表敏感键值访问，并强制执行强密码策略定期轮换管理员密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1341","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.BSO.4.21.0006072124320.28062-100000%40bearclaw.bogus.net","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20012","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0559.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0559","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0559.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0559.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mfrx-mc2c-9g9w/GHSA-mfrx-mc2c-9g9w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0559.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1341/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0447.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0447.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0447.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0443","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0443.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0538","title":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 管理员登录拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.5.1及更早版本的管理员登录页面存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向登录密码字段提交超长字符串，导致ColdFusion Administrator服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响ColdFusion Server 2.0/3.x/4.x系列版本，攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可触发，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中等。官方已发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0538"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57Z","remediation":"升级 ColdFusion Server 至 4.5.1 以上版本，或安装厂商当时发布的安全补丁。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Adobe 官方支持的现代 ColdFusion 版本（如 2023 或 2021 系列）。作为临时缓解措施，在防火墙上限制对 ColdFusion Administrator 登录页面的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理网段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96045469627806&w=2","http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=16122&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/3399","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1314","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4611","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19996","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2000/CVE-2000-0538.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0538.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0538","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/908.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0538.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0538.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2mg9-gqjh-3ggm/GHSA-2mg9-gqjh-3ggm.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-coldfusion.rules","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/cold_fusion_admin_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0443.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0443.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0443.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0433","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0433.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0520","title":"Stelian Pop dump 包 restore 子程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Stelian Pop 版本 0.4 dump 工具中的 restore 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序在处理超长磁带文件名时，由于未进行有效边界检查，导致堆栈缓冲区溢出，使攻击者能够劫持控制流并执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Stelian Pop 版本 0.4b17 及更早版本。攻击者只需在本地提供一个特定长度的磁带文件名即可触发，不需要任何身份验证即可完全破坏目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。（≈65字）","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0520"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54Z","remediation":"根据 Red Hat Bugzilla #11880 中的安全公告，建议立即升级到 Red Hat Linux 的 dump 升级版本或获取最新的 dump 软件包修复。您可以运行 \"yum update dump\" 或从 Red Hat 官网上下载并安装最新的 dump 软件包版本（当前版本高于 0.4b15-1）。如果无法立即升级，建议通过限制用户对 /tmp 目录的写权限并配置系统调用过滤器来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=11880","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=962403938