diation":"将 /etc/SnmpAgent.d/snmpd.conf 文件权限从世界可写修改为仅管理员可写，执行 chmod 600 /etc/SnmpAgent.d/snmpd.conf。同时修正 /etc/SnmpAgent.d/ 目录权限（该目录为 777 模式），执行 chmod 750 /etc/SnmpAgent.d/。将 snmpd 进程以非 root 用户（如 snmpd 用户）身份运行，避免以 root 权限启动。升级至 HP-UX 11.0 的最新安全补丁版本，HP 官方已发布针对此文件权限问题的安全修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1327","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200006070511.OAA05492%40dogfoot.hackerslab.org","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200006090640.XAA00779%40hpchs.cup.hp.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4643","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20002","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2b7e39540f8003a5fc1c3ce83959dcdba6671a4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0515.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0515","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aab9feabdc7192f1040b6d0a4deb6b961232c23a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0515.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d86f1beec7ec3be149cb88607f1d8e210a5ebad3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0515.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7pwx-75rm-fxfq/GHSA-7pwx-75rm-fxfq.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0515.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0515.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4fb9def3-4814-451d-9cb3-eef0e78269d2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0429.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1208","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0558","title":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager 6.1 的 Alarm 服务（OVALARMSRV，监听于 2345 端口）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向该服务发送特制的网络数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以服务进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 HP OpenView Network Node Manager 6.1 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商已发布安全公告并建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0558"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59Z","remediation":"升级 HP OpenView Network Node Manager 至 6.1 Patch 1 或更高版本，该补丁修复了 OVALARMSRV 服务（端口 2345）中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，在防火墙上阻止对 TCP 端口 2345 的入站访问，并限制仅允许受信任的管理主机连接该服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0249.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1317","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0558.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0558","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0558.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0558.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cmmr-4624-8pv4/GHSA-cmmr-4624-8pv4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0558.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.